// SPIR-V - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

; SPIR-V is a binary module. Its header is the magic word
; 0x07230203, little-endian, followed by version and generator.
; The Hello World! module below has no entry point.
; 07230203 00010000 00080001
